{
  "info": {
    "name": "DesApp — Autenticación y Catálogo",
    "description": "Alta, login, ApiKey y catálogo de jugadores de prueba. Ver specs/001-user-auth/, specs/002-api-key-issuance/ y specs/004-player-catalog/.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    { "key": "baseUrl", "value": "http://localhost:3000" },
    { "key": "accessToken", "value": "" },
    { "key": "apiKey", "value": "" },
    { "key": "playerId", "value": "" }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Register",
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
        "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/register", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["auth", "register"] },
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"ana@mail.com\",\n  \"password\": \"Abcd1234!\"\n}"
        },
        "description": "201 Created. No devuelve token. 409 si el email ya existe. 400 si la contraseña incumple la política."
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "Login",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
              "  pm.collectionVariables.set('accessToken', pm.response.json().accessToken);",
              "}"
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
        "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/login", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["auth", "login"] },
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"ana@mail.com\",\n  \"password\": \"Abcd1234!\"\n}"
        },
        "description": "200 con { accessToken, tokenType, expiresIn: 86400 }. 401 idéntico para email inexistente y contraseña incorrecta. El test-script guarda accessToken en la variable de colección."
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "Me (protegido)",
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{accessToken}}" }],
        "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/me", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["auth", "me"] },
        "description": "200 con { id, email } del dueño del token. 401 sin JWT, con uno inválido o vencido."
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "Emitir ApiKey",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.test('201 Created', function () {",
              "  pm.response.to.have.status(201);",
              "});",
              "pm.test('cuerpo cumple el esquema { id, apiKey, createdAt }', function () {",
              "  const body = pm.response.json();",
              "  pm.expect(body).to.have.property('id').that.is.a('string');",
              "  pm.expect(body).to.have.property('apiKey').that.matches(/^pmk_[0-9a-f]{64}$/);",
              "  pm.expect(body).to.have.property('createdAt');",
              "});",
              "if (pm.response.code === 201) {",
              "  pm.collectionVariables.set('apiKey', pm.response.json().apiKey);",
              "}"
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{accessToken}}" }],
        "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/api-key", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["auth", "api-key"] },
        "description": "201 Created con { id, apiKey, createdAt }. La ApiKey en texto plano solo se muestra en esta respuesta. Si el usuario ya tenía una ApiKey activa, queda invalidada de inmediato. 401 sin JWT, con uno inválido o vencido. El test-script guarda apiKey en la variable de colección para las requests del catálogo. Ver specs/002-api-key-issuance/."
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "Listar Jugadores",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
              "  const body = pm.response.json();",
              "  if (body.items && body.items.length > 0) {",
              "    pm.collectionVariables.set('playerId', body.items[0].id);",
              "  }",
              "}"
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [{ "key": "x-api-key", "value": "{{apiKey}}" }],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/players?league=La Liga&position=GK&page=1&pageSize=10",
          "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
          "path": ["players"],
          "query": [
            { "key": "league", "value": "La Liga" },
            { "key": "position", "value": "GK" },
            { "key": "page", "value": "1" },
            { "key": "pageSize", "value": "10" }
          ]
        },
        "description": "200 con { items, total, page, pageSize }. Filtros por liga/equipo/posición combinables con AND; sin coincidencias devuelve items: [] y total: 0 (no un error). 400 si liga/posición no son válidas o page/pageSize están fuera de rango. 401 sin ApiKey, con una inválida o revocada; un JWT no alcanza como alternativa. El test-script guarda el primer id en playerId. Ver specs/004-player-catalog/."
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "Detalle de Jugador",
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [{ "key": "x-api-key", "value": "{{apiKey}}" }],
        "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/players/{{playerId}}", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["players", "{{playerId}}"] },
        "description": "200 con { id, name, league, team, position } del jugador. 404 si el id no corresponde a ningún jugador del catálogo (formado o no). 401 sin ApiKey, con una inválida o revocada. Ver specs/004-player-catalog/."
      }
    }
  ]
}
